  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>嗨！TRS2 在此。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">每一套<strong>護甲</strong>（<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">皮革</span>、<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">銅</span>、鎖鏈、<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">鐵</span>、<span style=\"color:#ef0\">金</span>、<span style=\"color:#02eef1\">鑽石</span>與<span style=\"color:#f51622\">下界合金</span></strong>）現在都附帶配套的<strong>手套</strong>！此外，當你在裝備上套用<strong>鍛造模板</strong>時，飾紋同樣會套用至<strong>手套</strong>上！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>玩得開心...！！</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
